# A sweep exported from a real run may carry the host it ran on, the chassis it
# lives in and the customer it belongs to. The card model and the numbers are
# public; the identity of the machine is not. Sweeps that arrive here from
# somewhere else stay local, and the four in data/ are the ones that were
# de-identified on purpose.
*.local.json
sweeps/
